  "notes": "Cash basis county, governmental only. Governmental funds statement p5 (General, Road) continues on p6 (Covid ARP, Ag Society Building, Non-Major, Total Governmental Funds); statement amounts from the Total column p6. Roll-forward on fund balances: 8,357,584 + 9,272,874 - 8,995,156 + 2,829,472 - 2,829,472 + sale of assets 82,568 = 8,717,870. Taxes 4,680,673 split from Statement of Activities general receipts (p2): Property 4,359,699 + Motor Vehicle 317,916 + Lodging tax 3,058 (exact). Local kept other (context label; no breakdown of that line printed). Ending cash = TOTAL ASSETS 8,717,870 (cash 6,573,658 + restricted cash 2,144,212) of the governmental funds assets statement Total column (p4), as FY2023; beginning cash not printed. Balance sheet from the Statement of Assets and Fund Balances - Governmental Funds Total column (pp3-4; totals equal the government-wide Statement of Net Position p1). Detail: General Fund budget schedule (pp10-11; Local 771,103 equals the combining General Fund column, sale of assets 6 under other financing), Inheritance Tax Fund column from the General Fund combining page (p7; its transfers out 280,000 include 250,000 to the General Fund, eliminated within the Total General Fund column), budget schedules for Road, Covid ARP and Ag Society Building (pp12-14), and each non-major fund column from the combining statement (pp8-9). Ag Society Building Disbursements split using that fund's statement column (p6). Covid ARP disbursements 0; all-zero Federal Drug Law Enforcement, 911 Wireless Holding and Friends of the Courthouse funds omitted. General Fund capital outlay 124,153 (p7) sits inside the department lines of the budget schedule. Read pages 1-14 of 14"
